This package contains an independent ggml reimplementation of the
LAM Audio2Expression model and converts its published weights:

1. LAM_Audio2Expression (model architecture and pretrained weights)
   https://github.com/aigc3d/LAM_Audio2Expression
   Copyright 2024-2025 The Alibaba 3DAIGC Team Authors
   License: Apache-2.0 (code and released weights)
   The converted GGUF (lam-audio2exp-*.gguf) is a derived work of the
   released checkpoint `LAM_audio2exp_streaming.tar`.

2. wav2vec 2.0 base (audio encoder inside the LAM checkpoint)
   Originally released in fairseq (https://github.com/facebookresearch/fairseq)
   Copyright Facebook AI Research
   License: MIT (fairseq); distributed on HuggingFace as
   facebook/wav2vec2-base-960h. The encoder weights shipped here are the
   fine-tuned copies embedded in the LAM checkpoint above.

3. ggml (inference runtime, linked via the qvac-fabric vcpkg port)
   https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml
   Copyright The ggml authors
   License: MIT
